# North toggles an auto-fire C: on with one press, off with the next.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Toggle and turbo
tap north 30
advance 350
tap north 30
advance 300
---
key KEY_C down @0
key KEY_C up   @51
key KEY_C down @101
key KEY_C up   @151
key KEY_C down @201
key KEY_C up   @251
key KEY_C down @301
key KEY_C up   @351
